    "scenesThatPass": [
      "PINKBERRY: Hey, Alexandra, how are you, girl?\nALEXANDRA: Oh, I'm glad to see you, Pinkberry. I want to give you this, hold on.\nALEXANDRA: Please be there tonight, don't disappoint me! Mary's at 7. Got it? Mary's at 7!\nPINKBERRY: I will be there, promise.",
      "ALEXANDRA: OK, wait, wait, wait. I can't do this. Too much drama. This is not the answer. Stop for a second.\nSIN-DEE: You just come out here and give me all this information and just expect me to be like 'oh okay great, Alexandra'--\nALEXANDRA: Listen to me! I will go with you under one condition.\nSIN-DEE: You and conditions all the time--",
      "SIN-DEE: Fuck you, you lackey bitch.\nALEXANDRA: Sin-Dee, come on, remember last time? Calm.",
      "SIN-DEE: Can you help me the fuck OUT!!!\nALEXANDRA: I told you! I'm outta here! Bye.\nSIN-DEE: Girl! Alexandra, wait! Hold on!",
      "MADAM JILLIAN: You're not getting a freebie!\nJOHN GULAGER: Did you want me to call the cops?\nMADAM JILLIAN: Yeah, Genius. Great idea. Let's get the whole precinct down here."
    ]
